# Visible Text Gate · always on

Authority: `constitution/VISIBLE_TEXT.md`.
Policy registry reference: `policy_id: visible_text.finalization` (evidence/finalization only; not send/publish authority).

Any prose or microcopy created/rephrased by an AI and intended to be read by Christian, a customer, the public, a partner, or another human is **not final** until the relevant Visible Text Gate passes.

## Tier routing

Truth/source facts are universal. Then choose the smallest safe tier:

- `DRAFT_INTERNAL` — internal working draft only: truth/basic-safety; no mandatory reader-first, vfcopy or Humanizer ceremony.
- `FINAL_INTERNAL` — owner/internal document/UI: truth + final clarity/surface QA. Add `packages/vfcopy/hq/reader-first-he.md` + `.cursor/skills/vf-hebrew-copy/SKILL.md` + Humanizer only when sensitive or long (`>800` chars).
- `EXTERNAL_COMMITMENT` — customer/proposal/commitment: truth + `packages/vfcopy/hq/reader-first-he.md` + surface QA + exact body/hash binding. Use `.cursor/skills/vf-hebrew-copy/SKILL.md` when copy repair/quality work is relevant; domain packs remain authoritative for facts.
- `PUBLIC_PUBLISH` — public social/visual copy: full public chain, including `.cursor/skills/vf-hebrew-copy/SKILL.md` + Humanizer, VOICE/CTA where relevant, `NO_TEXT` for visual copy, and exact text identity.

A public/external surface may not downgrade itself to an internal tier. `scripts/vf_visible_text.py` enforces the compatibility table.

## Scope

Includes: ChatGPT/Cursor/Gemini/Perplexity/Grok owner-facing final prose, briefs, emails, customer replies, WhatsApp drafts, quotes, proposals, captions, Stories/Reels/carousels, cover/overlay/slide text, human-facing docs and AI-written UI microcopy.

Excludes from rewriting: verbatim source quotes, code, raw logs, filenames, IDs, hashes, URLs, machine JSON/CSV and canonical deterministic labels. AI-written explanation around them is in scope.

## Fail closed

- No `PASS` by declaration. If a required stage was not actually run, status is `UNPROVEN`/`DRAFT`/`BLOCKED`.
- Do not send/publish/render-as-final/surface-as-final after a failed gate.
- Exact approved static copy may be reused only unchanged; meaningful edits invalidate approval.
- An explicit owner wording preference is strong: validate it, do not rewrite its point back into generic marketing copy.
